      en: ["Part of the municipality of Gamprin-Bendern", "Located in direct proximity to the Rhine dam", "Historically characterized by agriculture", "Flood protection ensured by 20th-century dams", "Direct access to regional cycling path networks", "Preferred residential area in the Liechtenstein lowlands"],
